ss's instance as its str"] [620 1 "// value (queue 203: CPython takes any str; test_dict's test_instance_dict_getattr_str_subclass)."] [674 3 "// a generator's StopIteration carries its return value (PY7: next() raised a bare StopIteration, the slot's"] [675 3 "// Next ending with nil)"] [694 1 "// sortObjects sorts items in place by key (nil: the items) and reverse, stably: the keys computed in"] [695 1 "// order, then PY5b's SortObjects (list.sort's)."] [748 1 "// noFrameGlobals is the globals of a call with no Python frame: the running __main__'s"] [749 1 "// (_PyEval_GetGlobalsFromRunningMain), else a new dict."] [760 1 "// frameLocals is locals() of a frame (PEP 667): a module's or class's namespace (its mapping when that is no dict;"] [761 1 "// frameNamespace), else a new dict of a function's bound fast locals, cells and free variables, then its extra locals (the proxy's"] [762 1 "// snapshot, _PyEval_GetFrameLocals: a write to it does not reach the frame)."] [765 27 "// a call with no Python frame (an interpreter's call, queue 230)"] [797 1 "// builtinDir is dir(): the scope's names, or an object's __dir__() sorted (PY5c's lookup); without a"] [798 1 "// __dir__, a module's namespace, a type's and its bases', an object's type's and its __dict__'s."] [821 3 "// the object's __dir__ (object's, type's, module's, a class's own: PY5c's), its result sorted"] [837 3 "// the scope's names: a mapping not a dict (exec's locals; queue 219) by its keys"] [842 4 "// PyMapping_Keys"] [943 1 "// roundFloat is float.__round__ (Objects/floatobject.c's double_round): to an int, ties to even, without"] [944 1 "// ndigits; else the correctly rounded value at ndigits decimal places (round-half-even on the exact decimal"] [945 1 "// value, as dtoa's mode 3), negative ndigits rounding to tens, hundreds ..."] [967 2 "// the exact decimal value of x, rounded half-even at n places after the point"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[20 48] [26 49] [40 47] [58 46] [64 4